{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気だあや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫ちゃーんと生きてるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/06/4172737/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この通りね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまごのサンドウィッチ食べてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の事をお話いたしやしょっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだな～最近は5thに向けてちゃくちゃくと撮影中だよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成が楽しみでしーかたないっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで突然の私服のーっけ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/06/4172737/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背景の色塗りざつにもいと程があり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日はシンプルに真っ青なセーターで世を歩きまわってたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、洋服とか何かと青を選ぶ傾向が強くなりつつある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか青のものを見るとなんでも可愛い～～ってなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる人ーーー？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～まあ～ボチボチだよね＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んにアボカド"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/06/4172737/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間仕事でホテルにお泊りした時飛鳥と同じ部屋だってんてん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥はここぞとばかりにわたくしに甘えていらっしゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上がりになにを言い出すのかと思いきや髪の毛を乾かせと言いやがる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっ...しかたがねえなあ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか思いながらももくもくと乾かしてあげる優しい私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乾かしてるうちに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うっわぁ～～......私にはもうない長い髪...サラサラだあ～～\\(//∇//)\\❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつのまにかもくもくと飛鳥さんの髪の毛で遊び始める18歳能條愛未。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶目っ気満載だぜえ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/06/4172737/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか氏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、のねえ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ねえ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事だったんですがさあ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにしたのことのない格好をたーくさんさせていただたんたん(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ！！！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、え！？！？......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちょいちょい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いて待っててねって❤↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず次回質問返しますので\nよろぴく。"}],"source":"archive"}